00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,490
Slide 23 diagrams our production "SPARK OS DIRECTORY SETUP."

2
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:23,170
Look at the standardized directory hierarchy on the screen: /agents stores persona and system prompts; /skills contains modular tool execution scripts; /memory stores vector indexes and persistent logs; and /config holds environment secrets.

3
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:30,747
Notice how every tool is encapsulated as an independent skill module inside the /skills folder.

4
00:00:30,747 --> 00:00:37,480
This allows you to add new capabilities to your avatar without touching core reasoning logic.

5
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:45,190
Follow this clean directory pattern in your hands-on lab assignment to ensure maintainable, modular agent architecture!

